pdf.js
Copyright Mozilla Foundation and contributors.

This directory bundles a prebuilt copy of Mozilla pdf.js 6.3.289
(pdf.min.mjs, pdf.worker.min.mjs, cmaps/, standard_fonts/, wasm/, iccs/),
used by the PDF viewer (assets/pdf_viewer.html).

Since pdf.js 4.x the build is ESM only: pdf.min.mjs is loaded by a small
<script type="module"> shim in pdf_viewer.html that exposes it as
window.pdfjsLib for the classic inline script.

